/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Master Material: M_LightEmission_Master
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/Lighting/M_LightEmission_Master
Target Use: Highway street lamp fixtures, overhead gantry matrix displays,
            emergency phone beacons, vehicle headlights and taillights

SPECIFICATION & EMISSIVE REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. EMISSIVE COLOR & PHYSICAL ILLUMINANCE:
   - Param "EmissionColor" (LinearColor, Default=(1.0, 0.92, 0.82, 1.0)):
     4200K high-intensity LED highway lighting tone.
   - Param "EmissionIntensityNits" (Scalar, Default=50000.0):
     Calibrated in cd/m² (Nits) for physical auto-exposure compatibility.
   - Param "bUseSodiumVaporOrange" (StaticSwitch, Default=False):
     Switches to 2200K monochromatic high-pressure sodium orange (1.0, 0.55, 0.05).

2. CAMERA DISTANCE COMPENSATION:
   - Preserves apparent brightness and prevents bloom flicker at extreme distances
     down the 50km straightaway.
================================================================================
*/
